249
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:05,320
I'll tell you.

250
00:16:05,780 --> 00:16:06,860
Hurry up and tell us!

251
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:13,920
So my gags too,
it's as if I'm riding on Binka.

252
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:16,240
Don't collect data on us!

253
00:16:16,300 --> 00:16:19,120
We've taken quite a bit, haven't we.
Are you alright, Gorillac?

254
00:16:24,980 --> 00:16:27,460
Professor Esaki, he's suffering, isn't he?

255
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:29,900
No, it looked so fun that I finally

256
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:32,120
What's all this racket
first thing in the morning?

257
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:35,760
Ryo-chan accidentally drank

258
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:37,280
the relaxation drug that
Professor Esaki developed.

259
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:39,160
Relaxation drug?

260
00:16:39,560 --> 00:16:41,140
It's a kind of laughing drug.

261
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:44,600
That one's for laughing.

262
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,320
Kakiitaru

263
00:16:47,620 --> 00:16:49,060
Here, here, here, here!

264
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:51,420
When humans laugh, their brains

265
00:16:51,420 --> 00:16:52,860
release beta-endorphins,

266
00:16:52,860 --> 00:16:55,380
and that helps them relax.

267
00:16:55,380 --> 00:16:57,620
That's too much! Stop it quickly!

268
00:16:57,620 --> 00:16:59,060
You've had too much.

269
00:16:59,500 --> 00:17:01,320
The actual dose is 3 milliliters.

270
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:02,600
What?!

271
00:17:07,400 --> 00:17:08,700
When's it going to stop?

272
00:17:09,180 --> 00:17:10,540
It'll stop eventually, surely.

273
00:17:11,980 --> 00:17:14,160
About that scooter...

274
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:15,560
Scooter.

275
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:17,100
The other day...

276
00:17:17,100 --> 00:17:19,320
The young man who filed
the theft report, right?

277
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:20,660
Yes, yes.

278
00:17:20,660 --> 00:17:22,820
Ryo-chan, I'll handle it.

279
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:24,680
It's fine, I can do it.

280
00:17:25,380 --> 00:17:29,280
I heard the scooter was found.
Isn't it scratched or anything?

281
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,460
Hold on a second.

282
00:17:35,260 --> 00:17:38,520
Looks like some biker gang took it,
and there are no parts left.

283
00:17:38,520 --> 00:17:42,780
It's practically bulky trash.
It's already a write-off.

284
00:17:43,300 --> 00:17:45,340
You didn't have to put it like that,
did you?

285
00:17:45,340 --> 00:17:47,420
Reos, turn into a spirit!

286
00:17:47,960 --> 00:17:48,320
Yes.

287
00:17:49,660 --> 00:17:52,840
Because of you,
I got forced to switch out, dammit!

288
00:17:54,780 --> 00:17:55,180
What?

289
00:17:55,960 --> 00:17:57,780
What should we say and
go look at the Buruburu?

290
00:18:00,180 --> 00:18:03,100
Don't think you're getting away with that, you bastard!
Professor Esaki!

291
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:04,120
I figured it out!

292
00:18:06,260 --> 00:18:09,460
My abs are cramping up! Help me!

293
00:18:09,540 --> 00:18:11,560
I'll definitely catch the culprit,
I promise.

294
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:14,080
What kind of police box is this place?

295
00:18:14,820 --> 00:18:17,000
The drug's effects are more than enough.

296
00:18:17,500 --> 00:18:19,740
This isn't the time to be taking eyes too.

297
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:21,580
You'll really die at this rate.

298
00:18:22,840 --> 00:18:25,260
You'll pay for this! Just you wait!

299
00:18:25,560 --> 00:18:25,920
Yes!

300
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:26,580
Whoa!

301
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,520
Ryo-san!

302
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:28,500
W-what are you doing!

303
00:18:30,300 --> 00:18:31,360
Everyone!

304
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:31,620
Yes!

305
00:18:31,660 --> 00:18:32,080
Aaah!

306
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:34,020
Could it be...

307
00:18:34,020 --> 00:18:35,900
It's a relaxation drug!

308
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:42,480
Whoa, it's kicking in right away!

309
00:18:42,940 --> 00:18:46,920
Which is better, us or the drug?
It's taking effect faster!

310
00:18:47,140 --> 00:18:50,380
Hahaha, stop collecting data like that!

311
00:18:51,680 --> 00:18:55,460
Professor, academic background
has nothing to do with it, does it?

312
00:18:55,460 --> 00:18:58,260
It's sad that I'm a little behind too...

313
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:00,800
Senpai

314
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:01,920
What?

315
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:04,960
The futon flew away!

316
00:19:06,840 --> 00:19:09,600
That's hilarious, "the futon flew away"!

317
00:19:09,600 --> 00:19:11,840
Ow!

318
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:15,100
They're laughing at the gags, damn it.

319
00:19:15,100 --> 00:19:16,860
Not only that,

320
00:19:16,860 --> 00:19:20,120
there's also a side effect where you
end up making simple gags yourself.

321
00:19:20,940 --> 00:19:23,240
Ugh, the funny stuff with Kei-chan...

322
00:19:23,240 --> 00:19:24,800
Even Reiko's doing it now.

323
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:28,700
To stop laughing,
you have to think of something sad.

324
00:19:28,700 --> 00:19:31,060
Like breaking up with your lover,
for example.

325
00:19:31,940 --> 00:19:33,000
Let's try it.

326
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:37,500
It's over between us, Ryo.

327
00:19:37,500 --> 00:19:39,020
What's wrong, Reiko?

328
00:19:40,020 --> 00:19:41,840
What is it you don't like about me?

329
00:19:41,840 --> 00:19:42,880
Where do I start?

330
00:19:43,580 --> 00:19:46,280
Your chin, your mouth,
your nose, your eyes...

331
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:48,580
Your eyebrows, your hairstyle, everything.

332
00:19:48,580 --> 00:19:49,920
Just as I thought.

333
00:19:50,380 --> 00:19:51,500
Well then, sayonara!

334
00:19:51,700 --> 00:19:53,040
Ahahaha!

335
00:19:54,600 --> 00:19:55,380
It's no use!

336
00:19:58,620 --> 00:20:01,000
Hello, this is Kōen-mae police box.

337
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:02,800
Ugh, a bank robbery!

338
00:20:03,100 --> 00:20:04,060
Ahahaha!

339
00:20:04,180 --> 00:20:07,460
Sorry. It's not that it's funny or anything.

340
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,480
Uh-huh, uh-huh, understood.

341
00:20:10,800 --> 00:20:14,280
Hey, everyone, there's a robbery at Kame Bank,
and the robber's holed up inside.

342
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:16,120
We're heading out immediately!

343
00:20:17,120 --> 00:20:17,800
Aaaaaah

344
00:20:24,340 --> 00:20:28,040
Backup's taking forever...
what is everyone doing?

345
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:29,840
Aaaaaah

346
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:35,920
Leave the rest to us.

347
00:20:37,740 --> 00:20:38,920
So where's the culprit?

348
00:20:39,440 --> 00:20:40,220
Inside.

349
00:20:40,220 --> 00:20:42,940
Wait, why is everyone laughing?

350
00:20:43,080 --> 00:20:45,220
Who cares about that? Come on.

351
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:49,480
Guess we'd better go take
a look at the culprit's face.

352
00:21:00,560 --> 00:21:01,720
What are you guys?

353
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:07,060
You've got the very face of a criminal,
just like in a picture.

354
00:21:07,600 --> 00:21:09,460
You really do look just like the image.

355
00:21:11,120 --> 00:21:12,340
Don't laugh!

356
00:21:12,340 --> 00:21:14,080
Then I'll shoot if you laugh!

357
00:21:14,080 --> 00:21:14,200
No way!

358
00:21:14,660 --> 00:21:18,040
Aw, it's probably just a toy pistol!

359
00:21:18,040 --> 00:21:18,420
What?

360
00:21:20,860 --> 00:21:22,400
It's the real thing!

361
00:21:24,500 --> 00:21:27,800
Now you know! Come on, get outside!

362
00:21:30,660 --> 00:21:32,660
The real thing is a kettle!

363
00:21:34,840 --> 00:21:38,500
Hahaha, come on, Ken-chan!
You can't say that!

364
00:21:38,760 --> 00:21:39,960
Kettle trumpet!

365
00:21:40,180 --> 00:21:40,840
Pffft!

366
00:21:41,220 --> 00:21:42,200
Probably!

367
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:44,900
Nakagawa-san

368
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:49,820
When he gets in a cheerful mood,
he brings his own props and tells gags,

369
00:21:49,820 --> 00:21:52,120
What's wrong with you guys!

370
00:21:52,120 --> 00:21:52,520
Damn it!

371
00:21:53,100 --> 00:21:53,800
Ikkan!

372
00:21:54,020 --> 00:21:54,800
Bomb!

373
00:21:55,020 --> 00:21:55,680
Swap!

374
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:56,920
Sticky, sticky!

375
00:21:56,920 --> 00:22:00,880
What the hell are you guys!

376
00:22:02,380 --> 00:22:03,260
Oh no!

377
00:22:04,540 --> 00:22:06,200
What a dumb culprit!

378
00:22:09,780 --> 00:22:10,660
Help!

379
00:22:11,440 --> 00:22:13,760
It works on criminal types too.

380
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:14,980
Eeeeeeeh!

381
00:22:24,520 --> 00:22:30,760
Well, Ohara-kun, you all did a fine job.
You're sure to be made Commissioner-General!

382
00:22:31,820 --> 00:22:40,140
Think we can keep up the double crown award?
Don't say such unseemly things in front of the chief.

383
00:22:40,140 --> 00:22:42,120
It's probably not much money anyway, is it?

384
00:22:42,820 --> 00:22:45,060
Sorry, it's cheap.

385
00:22:45,060 --> 00:22:45,960
Just kidding.

386
00:22:48,520 --> 00:22:50,280
W-what's the meaning of this, you lot?

387
00:22:50,280 --> 00:22:52,780
The chief's flown off the handle!

388
00:22:52,780 --> 00:22:55,720
You idiot!

389
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,280
Even you, Ohara-kun?

390
00:22:57,720 --> 00:23:00,080
I'll have you all sent to
the remotest police box!

391
00:23:01,880 --> 00:23:03,120
I won't let you.

392
00:23:03,120 --> 00:23:04,320
Just kidding.

393
00:23:12,620 --> 00:23:16,180
Why do I have to be sent
to a place like this?

394
00:23:17,160 --> 00:23:20,400
If we're all together,
it's not lonely, right?

395
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:24,400
Apparently,
the drug's effects last over a week.

396
00:23:25,980 --> 00:23:28,820
Stop collecting data forever, damn it!

397
00:23:29,300 --> 00:23:31,100
That's enough!

398
00:23:31,100 --> 00:23:33,580
Here you are.

399
00:23:33,580 --> 00:23:34,920
Excuse us.

400
00:23:50,500 --> 00:23:53,080
Five worn-out ones, close as fish and water

401
00:24:01,120 --> 00:24:03,580
Always sandals, always scandal

402
00:24:03,580 --> 00:24:04,660
Never mind, they say

403
00:24:05,640 --> 00:24:07,260
Cool, wanna play?

404
00:24:07,260 --> 00:24:08,400
Everyday

405
00:24:10,340 --> 00:24:14,020
I crumpled up boredom in a
reprimand and tossed it away

406
00:24:15,160 --> 00:24:17,540
Maruzashi instinct, bare instinct

407
00:24:17,540 --> 00:24:18,540
Let's go crazy

408
00:24:20,400 --> 00:24:22,340
Even if we're poor, so what?

409
00:24:23,820 --> 00:24:28,120
I'll just do it my way, doing what I want

410
00:24:29,000 --> 00:24:32,700
The stiff chief's thunder,
smoke from his head

411
00:24:33,520 --> 00:24:35,700
If you run away, the camera catches you

412
00:24:35,700 --> 00:24:37,420
Well, how wonderful

413
00:24:38,160 --> 00:24:39,900
In the flower of Edo

414
00:24:40,640 --> 00:24:42,120
Ryōzan's great host

415
00:24:43,080 --> 00:24:45,500
Raging wild

416
00:24:45,500 --> 00:24:47,640
Working man play, nine times two

417
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:51,240
Jugemu, jugemu,
kokono suiki de gaijari suigo

418
00:24:51,240 --> 00:24:56,580
Suigo batsu, gungyo batsu,
gūraibatsu, gū neru tokoro ni sukutokoro

419
00:24:56,940 --> 00:25:01,200
Kyabura kōji, burakōji,
paipo paipo paipo no shūringan

420
00:25:01,200 --> 00:25:06,320
Shūringan no gūrindai,
gūrindai no ponpoko kī no ponpoko nādo

421
00:25:06,320 --> 00:25:07,940
Chō-kyūmei no Chōsuke

422
00:25:15,060 --> 00:25:18,160
Recently I was voted the cutest police officer,
number one.

423
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:20,140
Ryotsu Kankichi, apparently.

424
00:25:20,140 --> 00:25:21,800
My face is cute, you know.

425
00:25:21,800 --> 00:25:24,960
If you're going to say something,
at least say I'm cool or dependable.

426
00:25:24,960 --> 00:25:25,920
Well, whatever.

427
00:25:25,920 --> 00:25:29,320
If that's how it is,
I'll grow this cuteness into something big!

428
00:25:29,320 --> 00:25:31,640
Next time: Hana no Ko Ryo-chan.

429
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:32,720
See you then.

430
00:25:33,760 --> 00:25:35,800
Over there is a wall, kabe ari,

431
00:25:36,820 --> 00:25:38,980
I bet there's a turtle, kame ari.

432
00:25:39,940 --> 00:25:44,300
Everyone, come on over to our town!

433
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:45,920
Thank you.

